            <ArticleTitle>[Back pain in abdominal aortic aneurysm].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>2412-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Back pain is a typical symptom of abdominal aortic aneurysm. Symptoms of root compression may also be present if the aneurysm has caused changes to the vertebral column. A typical case is presented. The condition is life-threatening and requires vascular reconstruction.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
